From 611e5d682b994e54560c620fda09eb27d57f27ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: giri256 <80974392+giri256@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:07:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] klipper: encrypt history entries older than the newest N
 with a password

Adds HistoryVault (libsodium: Argon2id-wrapped X25519 key, per-entry sealed
key + XChaCha20-Poly1305), HistoryModel promotion/demotion keeping only the
newest PlaintextHistoryItems (default 5) in plaintext, async unlock/setup/
password change, auto-lock and screen-lock locking, and an autotest that scans
the database, WAL and data folder for leftover plaintext.

Also: owner-only permissions, secure_delete, background folder deletion,
batched setMaxSize shrink, model reset when the database is empty.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
