From b1f6a12cb255ab611145080fe87c69d0214ee16f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: giri256 <80974392+giri256@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:07:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] klipper: password unlock bar for encrypted history in the
 popup

DeclarativeHistoryModel exposes the vault state and operations and hides
locked rows; VaultBar.qml in the popup header handles setup, unlock (with
wrong-password feedback), password change and the forgotten-password reset.
Encrypted entries can't be edited.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
